  "note": "Rally restomod, not a production short-wheelbase F-250. Retains the 114.8 in short F-100 wheelbase and current G78-15-sized wheels. Uses F-250 4x2 drum-configuration tracks (63.65 / 62.44 in), FE 360 2V period gross torque and power anchors, NP435 wide-ratio four-speed, and an open 3.73:1 rally final drive. First is a crawler and fourth is direct. The existing shift solver uses a common synchronization model. Rear live axle with leaf springs is represented by the existing per-wheel 1DOF solver, tuned for an empty bed at 1.50 Hz with reduced bump and rebound damping. Mass, brake, aero, limiter, damping and interpolated torque are simulation estimates.",
